claim('demo-scope','fact','Available early demo has HTML5/Windows listing; Steam provides a demo while full game remains unreleased.',['itch','steam','identity'],'itch Run game/download and Platforms table; Steam Download Demo and full-game not-yet-available statement. releaseStatus refers to demo, not full Steam title.')
