content=f'# Worm Capitalist final content review\n\nReviewer: Codex agent, {now}. Separate read-through after implementation; parent must independently review before publishing.\n\nRead all current rendered main text and metadata, the two complete source feature descriptions, the current six route sources and client tools. Viewed all 24 current route screenshots at 390/768/1024/1440 and four filled worksheet screenshots. Content is legible, controls do not overlap, and collector found no horizontal overflow, internal broken link or client error. Initial truncated mobile branding and corrupted footer separators were corrected before final captures.\n\n## Claims and support\n\n'
