content+='## Scope and consistency\n\nAll game identity/platform and release descriptions agree. Only /, /profit-calculator/ and /walkthrough/ request indexing and appear in sitemap. About/legal pages are noindex. Twelve prior routes actually returned 404 locally. Public historical gameplay media was removed because reuse terms were unconfirmed; byte-preserving archives remain outside application output. No fixed itch build ID or iframe remains. A released demo is distinguished from an unreleased full Steam title.\n\nNo promise of Google indexing, optimal strategy, current feature completeness or Hlele gameplay is made. This is local production-export evidence. Current remote host and GSC are not certified. The formula has four actual output observations, including negative net and comparison. Its numeric defaults are blank and example values are explicitly synthetic.\n'
